      <div id="text-4" class="widget_text">
        <div class="textwidget">
          <h3>About the Artist</h3>
          <p>Fran Hopper (1922-2017) was a trailblazing female cartoonist who worked during the Golden Age of Comics. She created artwork for Fiction House publications including <em>Planet Comics</em>, contributing to series like "Gale Allen and the Girl Squadron" and "Mysta of the Moon."</p>
          <p>Her work was notable for featuring strong female protagonists in science fiction settings during an era when the comics industry was overwhelmingly male.</p>
          <p><strong>Fun fact:</strong> These comics are now in the public domain and preserved at archives like <a href="https://comicbookplus.com/">Comic Book Plus</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
